# Fcode environment variables (development only)
#
# Fcode does NOT require any build-time secrets.
# Provider API keys are entered by the user at runtime and stored in the
# Windows Credential Manager via the secure secret store.
#
# This file exists so developer-only overrides have a conventional home.
# Never commit a real .env file. Never place provider API keys here for
# anything other than local, temporary development experiments.

# Example (optional) - only used if you explicitly wire it up in dev:
# FCODE_DEV_OPENROUTER_KEY=sk-or-...
